## Migration runner fix — Data API single-statement splitter
command: npx vitest --run
timestamp: 2026-07-07T20:33:54Z
exit_code: 0
tests: 259/259 pass (+17 new splitter tests)
commit: (this commit)
files: services/api/src/sql-splitter.ts (new, dollar-quote-aware),
       services/api/src/migration-runner.ts (uses splitStatements per file),
       services/api/__tests__/sql-splitter.test.ts (17 tests against actual migration files)
bug: RDS Data API ExecuteStatement runs ONE statement per call; runner was
  sending whole files → "Multistatements aren't supported".
fix: split each file into individual statements; execute one at a time within
  the file's BeginTransaction. Splitter handles: $$, $tag$, '', --, /* */.

